---
// About Section Component
---

<section id="about-rayon" class="py-20 bg-brand-bg relative">
    <div class="max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">

        <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-16">
            <span class="text-brand-orange font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-xs bg-brand-warm px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-full border border-brand-light">
                Mengenal Rayon Kami
            </span>
            <h2 class="font-display text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-brand-slate mt-3">
                Tentang Rayon Cisarua 3
            </h2>
            <div class="w-16 h-1 bg-brand-orange mx-auto mt-4 rounded-full"></div>
        </div>

        <div class="grid lg:grid-cols-2 gap-12 items-center">

            <!-- Left Narrative -->
            <div class="space-y-6">
                <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded-3xl border border-slate-100 shadow-soft">
                    <h3 class="font-display text-2xl font-bold text-brand-slate mb-4 flex items-center gap-3">
                        <span class="w-8 h-8 rounded-lg bg-brand-orange text-white flex items-center justify-center text-sm shadow">
                            <i class="fas fa-compass"></i>
                        </span>
                        Sistem Bimbingan & Karakter
                    </h3>
                    <p class="text-brand-muted leading-relaxed mb-4">
                        Dalam ekosistem sekolah kami, <strong class="text-brand-slate">Rayon</strong> merupakan wadah pengasuhan, bimbingan karakter, serta kelompok sosial utama bagi setiap siswa berdasarkan daerah tempat tinggal.
                    </p>
                    <p class="text-brand-muted leading-relaxed">
                        <strong class="text-brand-orange">Rayon Cisarua 3</strong> menaungi siswa-siswi yang berdomisili di wilayah Cisarua dan sekitarnya. Di sini, kami memadukan bimbingan akademik dengan penanaman kedisiplinan, kemandirian, kepedulian sosial, dan kekeluargaan yang erat.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <!-- Core Pillars Grid -->
                <div class="grid sm:grid-cols-3 gap-4">
                    <div class="bg-white p-5 rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 text-center shadow-sm">
                        <div class="w-10 h-10 bg-orange-50 text-brand-orange rounded-xl mx-auto flex items-center justify-center mb-3">
                            <i class="fas fa-heart"></i>
                        </div>
                        <h4 class="font-display font-bold text-brand-slate text-sm">Kekeluargaan</h4>
                        <p class="text-xs text-brand-muted mt-1">Saling merangkul & membantu</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="bg-white p-5 rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 text-center shadow-sm">
                        <div class="w-10 h-10 bg-orange-50 text-brand-orange rounded-xl mx-auto flex items-center justify-center mb-3">
                            <i class="fas fa-user-shield"></i>
                        </div>
                        <h4 class="font-display font-bold text-brand-slate text-sm">Kedisiplinan</h4>
                        <p class="text-xs text-brand-muted mt-1">Tertib & tepat waktu</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="bg-white p-5 rounded-2xl border border-slate-100 text-center shadow-sm">
                        <div class="w-10 h-10 bg-orange-50 text-brand-orange rounded-xl mx-auto flex items-center justify-center mb-3">
                            <i class="fas fa-star"></i>
                        </div>
                        <h4 class="font-display font-bold text-brand-slate text-sm">Prestasi</h4>
                        <p class="text-xs text-brand-muted mt-1">Aktif & berdaya saing</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <!-- Right Feature Box -->
            <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-brand-orange via-orange-600 to-amber-700 text-white rounded-3xl p-8 sm:p-10 shadow-xl relative overflow-hidden">
                <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 transform translate-x-8 -translate-y-8 w-48 h-48 bg-white/10 rounded-full blur-xl"></div>

                <h3 class="font-display font-extrabold text-2xl mb-6 relative z-10">
                    Komitmen & Kebiasaan Baik
                </h3>

                <ul class="space-y-5 relative z-10 text-orange-50">
                    <li class="flex items-start gap-4">
                        <div class="w-7 h-7 rounded-full bg-white/20 flex items-center justify-center text-white font-bold flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5">
                            <i class="fas fa-check text-xs"></i>
                        </div>
                        <div>
                            <h4 class="font-bold text-white text-base">Pembiasaan & Karakter Harian</h4>
                            <p class="text-xs text-orange-100 mt-0.5">Pelaksanaan ibadah rutin, kerapihan, dan pemantauan jurnal kebiasaan baik harian.</p>
                        </div>
                    </li>
                    <li class="flex items-start gap-4">
                        <div class="w-7 h-7 rounded-full bg-white/20 flex items-center justify-center text-white font-bold flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5">
                            <i class="fas fa-check text-xs"></i>
                        </div>
                        <div>
                            <h4 class="font-bold text-white text-base">Lingkungan Suportif & Ramah</h4>
                            <p class="text-xs text-orange-100 mt-0.5">Ruang aman bebas perundungan, tempat di mana senior dan junior saling membimbing.</p>
                        </div>
                    </li>
                    <li class="flex items-start gap-4">
                        <div class="w-7 h-7 rounded-full bg-white/20 flex items-center justify-center text-white font-bold flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5">
                            <i class="fas fa-check text-xs"></i>
                        </div>
                        <div>
                            <h4 class="font-bold text-white text-base">Monitoring Perkembangan Belajar</h4>
                            <p class="text-xs text-orange-100 mt-0.5">Pendampingan nilai akademik, kehadiran, dan bimbingan kepribadian siswa.</p>
                        </div>
                    </li>
                </ul>

                <div class="mt-8 pt-6 border-t border-white/20 flex items-center justify-between text-xs text-orange-200">
                    <span>Rayon Cisarua 3 &bull; Wikrama Culture</span>
                    <span class="font-semibold text-white">#Cisarua3Solid</span>
                </div>
            </div>

        </div>
    </div>
</section>
